     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation KrimskyTestExample</b></p><a name=\"KrimskyTestExample\"> </a><a name=\"hcKrimskyTestExample\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-krimsky-test.html\">Krimsky Test</a></p></div><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category exam}\">Exam</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs krimsky-test}\">Krimsky test</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-PatientExample.html\">Patient Example  Female, DoB: 1990-01-01 ( Passport number: PA1234567)</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2026-08-18 09:00:00+0000</p><p><b>performer</b>: <a href=\"Practitioner-OphthalmologistExample.html\">Practitioner Ophthalmologist Example </a></p><p><b>note</b>: </p><blockquote><div><p>Exotropia 30 PD FOD / 25 PD FOI, comitant in the five principal gaze positions.</p>\n</div></blockquote><p><b>hasMember</b>: </p><ul><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyPrimaryFODExample.html\">Primary position - FOD, 30 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyPrimaryFOIExample.html\">Primary position - FOI, 25 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyUpFODExample.html\">Up gaze (supraversion) - FOD, 30 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyUpFOIExample.html\">Up gaze (supraversion) - FOI, 25 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyDownFODExample.html\">Down gaze (infraversion) - FOD, 30 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyDownFOIExample.html\">Down gaze (infraversion) - FOI, 25 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyRightFODExample.html\">Right gaze (dextroversion) - FOD, 30 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyRightFOIExample.html\">Right gaze (dextroversion) - FOI, 25 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyLeftFODExample.html\">Left gaze (levoversion) - FOD, 30 PD exodeviation</a></li><li><a href=\"Observation-KrimskyLeftFOIExample.html\">Left gaze (levoversion) - FOI, 25 PD exodeviation</a></li></ul><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs test-distance-category}\">Test distance</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs far}\">Far</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs correction-status}\">Correction status</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">With correction</span></p></blockquote></div>"
